"On November 12th 2016, thousands of people marched through the 5th Avenue in New York City from Union Square to the Trump Tower as a protest to the president elect Donald Trump. Along the way, you can hear the crowd chanting: \'93We are the popular vote\'94, \'93Donald Trump go away, racist, sexist, anti-gay\'94, \'93Emigrant rights are human rights\'94, \'93Tell what democracy looks like. \'96 This is what democracy looks like\'94, \'93Hands too small can\'92t build the wall\'94, \'93Black lives matter\'94 and \'93We reject the president elect.\'94"\
